invariant: INV-44
file: p384_wide_verify.c
catches: p384_equiv_test
reason: the host verifier computes on a key the decoder refused, which
  the decoder had already written. bin/p384_equiv_test gives it a key
  off the curve under the one signature that key's multiple makes, and
  wants 0.

--- old
    if (!p384_wide_point_decode(&q, pub)) {
        return 0;
    }
--- new
    (void)p384_wide_point_decode(&q, pub);
